      "person_id": "908_816_219",
      "event_type": "death",
      "source_term": "黃武七年，範遷大司馬，印綬未下，疾卒",
      "date_expression": "黃武七年",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "work_id": "w-sanguozhi",
          "book_id": "b-sanguozhi-056",
          "chapter_id": "c-sanguozhi-056-lvfan",
          "source_id": "s-sanguozhi-056-lvfan",
          "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-056-lvfan:line053",
          "quote": "　　黃武七年，範遷大司馬，印綬未下，疾卒。權素服舉哀，遣使者追贈印綬。及還都建業，權過範墓呼曰：「子衡！」言及流涕，祀以太牢。範長子先卒，次子據嗣。",
          "person_mention_id": "c-sanguozhi-056-lvfan:line053:m0007"
        }
      ],
      "interpretation_note": "本來源所記。",
